## File Map (what changes)

```
parser/
├── preprocessor.py    ← NEW (~200 lines, spaCy-based)
├── ast_nodes.py       ← unchanged
├── parser.py          ← unchanged (minor grammar tweaks possible)
├── resolver.py        ← unchanged
├── compiler.py        ← unchanged
├── pipeline.py        ← updated (add preprocess() call)
├── normalizer.py      ← can be REMOVED (replaced by preprocessor.py)
├── semantic_resolver.py ← can be REMOVED (replaced by resolver.py)
└── __init__.py        ← updated (export preprocess)
```

The old [normalizer.py](file:///c:/Users/Prashant/Documents/NLMongo_Project/nl_to_mongo/parser/normalizer.py) and [semantic_resolver.py](file:///c:/Users/Prashant/Documents/NLMongo_Project/nl_to_mongo/parser/semantic_resolver.py) were doing partial versions of what the new preprocessor + resolver do. With the preprocessor in place, they're fully superseded.
